{2\\sqrt{u}}\\cdot (9-10x) \\\\  & =-\\frac{10x-9}{2\\sqrt{-5{x}^{2}+9x}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{10x-9}{2\\sqrt{-5{x}^{2}+9x}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $x=1,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=1} & ={(-\\frac{10x-9}{2\\sqrt{-5{x}^{2}+9x}})|}_{x=1} \\\\  & =\\frac{9-10(1)}{2\\sqrt{-5(1{)}^{2}+9(1)}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-1}{2\\sqrt{4}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139538978 17592186045443 true] [17592186674316 1075 #edb/ref 17592186674307 13194139538978 17592186045443 true] [17592186674316 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139538978 17592186045443 true] [17592186674316 1077 "field-1" 13194139538978 17592186045443 true] [17592186674316 1078 #edb/ref 17592186674307 13194139538978 17592186045443 true] [17592186674316 1079 #uuid "b024a65a-2e57-571c-a34d-025276659956" 13194139538978 17592186045443 true] [17592186674317 1075 #edb/ref 17592186674321 13194139538978 17592186045443 true] [17592186674317 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139538978 17592186045443 true] [17592186674317 1077 "field-1" 13194139538978 17592186045443 true] [17592186674317 1078 #edb/ref 17592186674321 13194139538978 17592186045443 true] [17592186674317 1079 #uuid "c0342523-f1be-5f79-85fa-6dd2455256a4" 13194139538978 17592186045443 true] [17592186674318 1075 #edb/ref 17592186674310 13194139538978 17592186045443 true] [17592186674318 1075 #edb/ref 17592186674311 13194139538978 17592186045443 true] [17592186674318 1075 #edb/ref 17592186674314 13194139538978 17592186045443 true] [17592186674318 1075 #edb/ref 17592186674320 13194139538978 17592186045443 true] [17592186674318 1075 #edb/ref 17592186674323 13194139538978 17592186045443 true] [17592186674318 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139538978 17592186045443 true] [17592186674318 1077 "selection" 13194139538978 17592186045443 true] [17592186674318 1078 #edb/ref 17592186674320 13194139538978 17592186045443 true] [17592186674318 1079 #uuid "c28412ef-227e-5ded-9964-e41d96174b86" 13194139538978 17